      "id": "inspired-product-s055-p00388",
      "source_en": "An important element to product vision is identifying the things that are changing—as well as the things that likely won’t be changing—in the time frame of the product vision. Some product visions are wildly optimistic and unrealistic about how fast things will change, and others are far too conservative. This is usually the most difficult aspect of a good product vision.",
